    {
      "card": {
        "bgColor": "var(--gray-3)",
        "icon": "page",
        "label": "Lesson 23 • Requesting A Bank Loan",
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "description": [
              {
                "text": "Ivan meets with Gina, a loan officer at L&S Bank, about getting a loan to start a new coffee shop. When Gina reviews his financial forecasts and suggests some changes, Ivan is angry at first but then decides to go along with it."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Ivan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I'm here to see about getting a $100,000 loan to start a Coffee Shack franchise."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Gina: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I see from your application that you"
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "'ve"
                },
                {
                  "text": " already got two franchise businesses "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "under your belt"
                },
                {
                  "text": " - both Subway sandwich shops. That's certainly "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "nothing to sneeze at"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Ivan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Thank you. Now that I "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "know the franchise business inside and out"
                },
                {
                  "text": ", I'd like to expand."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Gina: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Well, Subway is a sandwich shop. Now you're talking about a coffee house. That's an entirely "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "different animal"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Ivan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Sure, there may be a thing or two to learn, but it should be more or less a "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "no-brainer"
                },
                {
                  "text": ","
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Gina: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I see from your business plan that you're basing all of your profit estimates on the profits you made from one of your Subway shops. I don't think that's right. You're "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "comparing apples to oranges"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Ivan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Apples? Oranges? I didn't know we were talking about fruit now. Maybe I should open up a fruit smoothie shop instead!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Gina: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Ha ha. Well, at least you haven't lost your sense of humor!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Ivan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Well, seriously, what do you want me to do?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Gina: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Go "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "back to the drawing board"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". Make some new calculations based on selling coffee, not sandwiches. Then the loan will be "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "in the bag"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Ivan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "If you're going to make me "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "jump through hoops"
                },
                {
                  "text": " to get this loan, I'll just have to take my business to a different bank."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Gina: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "You're "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "missing the point"
                },
                {
                  "text": " here. I'm not trying to make your life difficult. I'm just suggesting you "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "beef up"
                },
                {
                  "text": " your business plan so my boss will approve your loan."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Ivan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Well, in that case, maybe I will "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "go back to the drawing board"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
